    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rooney Auctioneers are delighted to present 140 Oakleigh Wood, Dooradoyle, Limerick, V94 NP38 to the market.\r\n\r\nThis superb and spacious three-bedroom ground floor apartment is presented in immaculate turnkey condition, offering bright, modern and exceptionally well-maintained accommodation throughout.\r\n\r\nNo. 140 also benefits from a private, landscaped rear garden providing much-needed outdoor space to relax and enjoy.\r\n\r\nThis exceptionally spacious apartment has been extended to the rear, creating a second large living room/sunroom with double doors opening directly onto the rear garden. The accommodation comprises a large open-plan living, kitchen and dining area with modern fitted kitchen units, a main bathroom and three large double bedrooms, with the main bedroom benefiting from an ensuite bathroom.\r\n\r\nThis outstanding property offers spacious, modern and turnkey accommodation in a highly convenient and centrally located setting, making it an ideal home. The property also benefits from an allocated parking \r\nspace located directly outside the building, along with ample \r\nadditional communal parking.\r\n\r\n\r\nNo. 140 oakleigh Wood represents a rare opportunity to acquire a truly exceptional property in one of Dooradoyle's most sought-after residential developments. The location offers unrivalled convenience, with an abundance of amenities within walking distance, including The Crescent Shopping Centre (less than 1km away), Crescent College Comprehensive (approximately 750m), University Hospital Limerick, Raheen Business Park, excellent primary and secondary schools, shops, restaurants, sporting facilities and regular public transport links. The M20, M7 and Shannon Airport are also easily accessible, making this an ideal location for commuters.\r\n\r\nCombining stylish, spacious accommodation with a superb location and private outdoor space, No. 140 Oakleigh Wood is sure to appeal to all and viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall:\r\n Large, bright entrance hall with built-in storage and attractive wood flooring.\r\nKitchen/Dining/Living Room: 8.94m x 5.32m\r\n Large, spacious open-plan room featuring a beautiful modern fitted kitchen with centre island. The kitchen benefits from recessed spotlights and pendant lighting, with integrated dishwasher and washing machine, hob, extractor fan and double oven included. Double glass doors lead from the hallway into the open-plan living area, which opens through to the extended second living room/sunroom at the rear. The bright living area features a large window overlooking the private rear garden and attractive wood flooring throughout.\r\nSunroom/Living Room 2: 4.14m x 3.40,m\r\n A stunning, bright and modern extension to the rear, featuring French doors opening directly onto the large private rear garden. Finished with solid wood flooring and recessed spotlights, this superb additional living space is a wonderful addition to the property.\r\nBedroom 1: 3.86m x 3.59m\r\n Bright and spacious rear-facing double bedroom overlooking the garden. The room features wood flooring and built-in sliderobes providing ample storage, with an ensuite located off the bedroom.\r\nEnsuite: 1.92m x 1.74m\r\n Bright, modern ensuite comprising WC, wash hand basin and power shower. Fully tiled throughout.\r\nBedroom 2: 3.77m x 3.95m\r\n Bright, spacious front-facing double bedroom with wood flooring and built-in wardrobes.\r\nBedroom 3: 4.24m x 2.55m\r\n Bright rear-facing double bedroom featuring wood flooring and built-in sliderobe wardrobes.\r\nBathroom: 3.08m x 1.97m\r\n Bright, modern bathroom comprising WC, wash hand basin and electric shower. Fully tiled throughout."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Additional Features\r\n\r\nBuilt in 2001\r\nOverall floor area: approximately 104.7 m² / 1,159 sq. ft.\r\nBlinds and light fittings included\r\nAppliances included\r\n Annual management fee: approximately €1140 \r\nGas-fired central heating\r\nLarge private, landscaped rear garden\r\n Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate this stunning property"
      },
